WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.935
Wujing watched as the fake Wujing fed the horse some hay.

2
00:00:08.936 --> 00:00:13.865
"I don't know how you made fake versions of us, Wukong," said the purple spirit.

3
00:00:13.866 --> 00:00:18.558
"But you won't get the True Scriptures without the real Tang Monk."

4
00:00:18.559 --> 00:00:24.364
Wukong folded his arms. "Oh yes, I will."

5
00:00:24.365 --> 00:00:28.281
Wujing leaped into the air and flew south.

6
00:00:28.282 --> 00:00:32.132
"I'll tell the bodhisattva what Wukong is doing," he thought.

7
00:00:32.133 --> 00:00:35.148
"She can stop him."

8
00:00:35.149 --> 00:00:40.771
When Wujing arrived at Mount Potalaka, he was even more shocked.

9
00:00:40.772 --> 00:00:44.950
Wukong was meditating in the bodhisattva's garden.

10
00:00:44.951 --> 00:00:49.758
"Wukong!" cried Wujing. "How did you get here so fast?"

11
00:00:49.759 --> 00:00:52.758
"What are you talking about?" asked the monkey.

12
00:00:52.759 --> 00:00:57.665
[g@Guanyin came out of her pagoda.

13
00:00:57.666 --> 00:01:00.603
"Wujing, what are you doing here?"@g]

14
00:01:00.604 --> 00:01:02.756
[g@The purple spirit bowed.

15
00:01:02.757 --> 00:01:05.913
"Bodhisattva, I must speak with you.@g]

16
00:01:05.914 --> 00:01:10.458
Wukong has made fake versions of me, Bajie, and the Tang Monk.

17
00:01:10.459 --> 00:01:13.487
He's planning to make the journey without us."

18
00:01:13.488 --> 00:01:16.182
"What!" shouted Wukong.

19
00:01:16.183 --> 00:01:18.652
Wujing glanced at the monkey.

20
00:01:18.653 --> 00:01:21.765
"I just saw him on the Fruit and Flower Mountain.

21
00:01:21.766 --> 00:01:26.147
I don't know how he got here before me."

22
00:01:26.148 --> 00:01:29.414
"You're lying!" yelled Wukong.

23
00:01:29.415 --> 00:01:33.192
Guanyin smiled. "You're mistaken, Wujing.

24
00:01:33.193 --> 00:01:36.205
Wukong has been here the whole time."

25
00:01:36.206 --> 00:01:39.960
Wujing was surprised. "He has?"

26
00:01:39.961 --> 00:01:42.312
Guanyin nodded.

27
00:01:42.313 --> 00:01:44.106
Wukong made a fist.

28
00:01:44.107 --> 00:01:46.498
[g@"Someone is pretending to be me!

29
00:01:46.499 --> 00:01:49.276
And he's living on my mountain!@g]

30
00:01:49.277 --> 00:01:51.028
[g@I'm going there right now.

31
00:01:51.029 --> 00:01:53.545
I'm going to destroy him!"@g]

32
00:01:53.546 --> 00:02:00.461
"I'll go with you," said Wujing.

33
00:02:00.462 --> 00:02:07.202
Wukong and Wujing soon arrived on the Fruit and Flower Mountain.

34
00:02:07.203 --> 00:02:11.999
The monkey's eyes burned with anger when he saw the fake Wukong.

35
00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:15.660
"Who are you?" demanded Wukong.

36
00:02:15.661 --> 00:02:19.425
"Who are [i@you?@i]" asked the fake Wukong.

37
00:02:19.426 --> 00:02:26.365
"I am Sun Wukong, king of the Fruit and Flower Mountain!"

38
00:02:26.366 --> 00:02:28.785
"No," said the other monkey.

39
00:02:28.786 --> 00:02:33.404
"[i@I@i] am Sun Wukong, king of the Fruit and Flower Mountain!"

40
00:02:33.405 --> 00:02:37.651
Furious, Wukong pulled out his iron bar.

41
00:02:37.652 --> 00:02:43.885
The fake Wukong pulled out his iron bar.

42
00:02:43.886 --> 00:02:48.577
Wukong attacked, and so did the fake Wukong. [i@Clang!@i]

43
00:02:48.578 --> 00:02:52.401
The ground shook as the iron bars crashed into each other.

44
00:02:52.402 --> 00:02:56.741
The two monkeys fought with fury.

45
00:02:56.742 --> 00:03:01.673
Wujing watched as one Wukong struck the other. [i@Crack!@i]

46
00:03:01.674 --> 00:03:07.916
The other Wukong blocked the bar and swung back. [i@Bam!@i]

47
00:03:07.917 --> 00:03:12.214
"Wujing, help me!" cried one Wukong.

48
00:03:12.215 --> 00:03:16.627
Wujing raised his spear and was about to enter the fight.

49
00:03:16.628 --> 00:03:18.309
[g@The other Wukong shouted.

50
00:03:18.310 --> 00:03:21.264
"No, Wujing! Help [i@me@i]!"@g]

51
00:03:21.265 --> 00:03:25.622
[g@Wujing looked from one Wukong to the other.

52
00:03:25.623 --> 00:03:28.847
"Who is the real Wukong?"@g]

53
00:03:28.848 --> 00:03:33.343
"I am!" shouted one Wukong as he struck at the other.

54
00:03:33.344 --> 00:03:39.850
"No!" shouted the other Wukong, blocking the first one's attack. "[i@I@i] am!"

55
00:03:39.851 --> 00:03:43.233
"Don't listen to him!" cried one monkey.

56
00:03:43.234 --> 00:03:49.106
"Don't listen to [i@him@i]!" cried the other.

57
00:03:49.107 --> 00:03:51.322
[g@Wujing stamped his foot.

58
00:03:51.323 --> 00:03:54.235
"Stop fighting!" he shouted.@g]

59
00:03:54.236 --> 00:03:57.191
[g@Instantly both monkeys stopped fighting.

60
00:03:57.192 --> 00:03:59.490
They looked at the purple spirit.@g]

61
00:03:59.491 --> 00:04:03.892
"I don't know which one of you is the real Wukong," said Wujing.

62
00:04:03.893 --> 00:04:05.676
[g@"Go to Mount Potalaka.

63
00:04:05.677 --> 00:04:08.481
Guanyin will be able to tell who is who.@g]

64
00:04:08.482 --> 00:04:12.677
I will return to the Tang Monk to tell him what's going on."

65
00:04:12.678 --> 00:04:16.037
The two Wukongs glanced at each other.

66
00:04:16.038 --> 00:04:18.735
"That's a good idea," said one of them.

67
00:04:18.736 --> 00:04:23.310
"Guanyin will easily see that I am the real Wukong."

68
00:04:23.311 --> 00:04:26.669
"It [i@is@i] a good idea," the other agreed.

69
00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:32.820
"Guanyin will easily see that [i@I@i] am the real Wukong."

70
00:04:32.821 --> 00:04:36.787
Soon the two Wukongs stood before Guanyin.

71
00:04:36.788 --> 00:04:39.625
She looked carefully at each one.

72
00:04:39.626 --> 00:04:44.655
"I can't tell which one of you is the real Wukong," she said.

73
00:04:44.656 --> 00:04:47.719
[g@One Wukong took a deep breath.

74
00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.731
"Use the Tight Headband spell.@g]

75
00:04:49.732 --> 00:04:54.134
The spell will work only with my headband—the real headband."

76
00:04:54.135 --> 00:04:56.315
[g@"Yes!" said the other one.

77
00:04:56.316 --> 00:04:57.752
"Use the Tight Headband spell!@g]

78
00:04:57.753 --> 00:05:07.190
The spell will only work with [i@my@i] headband."

